{"4012470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tale of Dark Light", "steam_appid": 4012470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is a game I developed solo, and it's also my first developed game. Though it's quite simple, I hope you'll enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cute fantasy-themed ARPG looter game. All you need to do is grind, grind, and grind to collect a full set of equipment that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the main character, deftly dodging enemy attacks, consuming food to recover health or enhance your abilities, and using normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies. Gain experience, level up continuously, and allocate your attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to obtain powerful equipment! The more challenging the map, the higher the chance of dropping advanced gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment comes with varying random rarities and numbers of attributes. Don’t forget that you can reforge equipment attributes at the blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many equipment items also come with set bonuses—wearing a full set will make you even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cute little cat might also hide some secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For potential buyers of this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Diablo-like games and looter enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who prefer to skip cutscenes, as there is barely any storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are inspired by and pay tribute to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question feedback QQ group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >127552378</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is a game I developed solo, and it's also my first developed game. Though it's quite simple, I hope you'll enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cute fantasy-themed ARPG looter game. All you need to do is grind, grind, and grind to collect a full set of equipment that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the main character, deftly dodging enemy attacks, consuming food to recover health or enhance your abilities, and using normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies. Gain experience, level up continuously, and allocate your attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to obtain powerful equipment! The more challenging the map, the higher the chance of dropping advanced gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment comes with varying random rarities and numbers of attributes. Don’t forget that you can reforge equipment attributes at the blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many equipment items also come with set bonuses—wearing a full set will make you even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cute little cat might also hide some secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For potential buyers of this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Diablo-like games and looter enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who prefer to skip cutscenes, as there is barely any storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are inspired by and pay tribute to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question feedback QQ group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >127552378</p>", "short_description": "This is a cute fantasy-themed ARPG looter game. You will control the main character, deftly dodging enemy attacks, consuming food to recover health or enhance your abilities, and using normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012